            "rawHtml": "<h3>04 -- LAYER 4 CONTROLS</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Example Scenario: Isolating a Payment Application A business keeps its database tier from communicating with the internet at all, and ensures a breached</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>load balancer can&#x27;t pivot to sensitive data. Internet Load Balancer App Servers (DMZ) Database Tier allow: 443 allow: app port allow: DB port only Database has no direct path to the internet, at all If the load balancer is breached, the attacker is still confined to the app tier&#x27;s allowed ports -- they cannot reach the database directly. NETWORK SEGMENTATION &amp; MICROSEGMENTATION 13</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "04 -- LAYER 4 CONTROLS Example Scenario: Isolating a Payment Application A business keeps its database tier from communicating with the internet at all, and ensures a breached load balancer can't pivot to sensitive data. Internet Load Balancer App Servers (DMZ) Database Tier allow: 443 allow: app port allow: DB port only Database has no direct path to the internet, at all If the load balancer is breached, the attacker is still confined to the app tier's allowed ports -- they cannot reach the database directly. NETWORK SEGMENTATION & MICROSEGMENTATION 13",
