            "eyebrow": "CIT 220 • Unit 02.2",
            "subtitle": "Approach Two: Application Segmentation (Layer 4)",
            "lead": "04 -- LAYER 4 CONTROLS Segmenting in the Dark Neither network- nor Layer 4 application segmentation reliably gives you what you actually need at",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>04 -- LAYER 4 CONTROLS</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Segmenting in the Dark Neither network- nor Layer 4 application segmentation reliably gives you what you actually need at</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>every stage: an accurate, real-time view of your environment. Before segmenting Visualize application dependencies so policy rules are drawn up accurately -- guessing here breaks applications later. After segmenting Prove the policy is working as intended -- for your own security posture and for regulators. Ongoing Without real-time and historical visibility, evidence has to be collected manually -- slow, costly, and error-prone. A segmentation solution that can&#x27;t provide this kind of visibility, at every stage, is simply not enough. NETWORK SEGMENTATION &amp; MICROSEGMENTATION 16</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "04 -- LAYER 4 CONTROLS Segmenting in the Dark Neither network- nor Layer 4 application segmentation reliably gives you what you actually need at every stage: an accurate, real-time view of your environment. Before segmenting Visualize application dependencies so policy rules are drawn up accurately -- guessing here breaks applications later. After segmenting Prove the policy is working as intended -- for your own security posture and for regulators. Ongoing Without real-time and historical visibility, evidence has to be collected manually -- slow, costly, and error-prone. A segmentation solution that can't provide this kind of visibility, at every stage, is simply not enough. NETWORK SEGMENTATION & MICROSEGMENTATION 16",
