            "lead": "05 -- LAYER 7 MICROSEGMENTATION Approach Three: Microsegmentation to Layer 7 Layer 7 is the application layer -- where network services integrate",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>05 -- LAYER 7 MICROSEGMENTATION</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Approach Three: Microsegmentation to Layer 7 Layer 7 is the application layer -- where network services integrate</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>with the operating system itself, and where protocols like HTTP , FTP , TFTP , and SMTP live. Process- and flow-based Policy references specific processes and flows, not just IP addresses and ports. Effective within a tier Limits lateral movement even inside a single application cluster or tier. Sensitive to the smallest signal Can spot a threat from something as small as the wrong hash, even if an attacker mirrors an authorized process. LAYER 7 Application Layer HTTP  ·  FTP  ·  TFTP  ·  SMTP Default-deny allowlisting: Only exact, approved processes or flows communicate. Everything else is blocked automatically. NETWORK SEGMENTATION &amp; MICROSEGMENTATION 17</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "05 -- LAYER 7 MICROSEGMENTATION Approach Three: Microsegmentation to Layer 7 Layer 7 is the application layer -- where network services integrate with the operating system itself, and where protocols like HTTP , FTP , TFTP , and SMTP live. Process- and flow-based Policy references specific processes and flows, not just IP addresses and ports. Effective within a tier Limits lateral movement even inside a single application cluster or tier. Sensitive to the smallest signal Can spot a threat from something as small as the wrong hash, even if an attacker mirrors an authorized process. LAYER 7 Application Layer HTTP  ·  FTP  ·  TFTP  ·  SMTP Default-deny allowlisting: Only exact, approved processes or flows communicate. Everything else is blocked automatically. NETWORK SEGMENTATION & MICROSEGMENTATION 17",
