            "rawHtml": "<h3>05 -- LAYER 7 MICROSEGMENTATION</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Catching What Layer 4 Can&#x27;t See Layer 4 only asks: is this port open? Layer 7 asks a sharper question: is this the exact, verified process I</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>expect to see here? ATTACK TECHNIQUE LAYER 4 RESULT LAYER 7 RESULT Attacker rides an open port Allowed -- port is open Blocked -- process identity doesn&#x27;t match Spoofed source IP address May pass -- rule matches IP range Irrelevant -- policy isn&#x27;t based on IP alone Lateral move within same tier Not addressed -- tier boundary already crossed Blocked -- each flow is evaluated individually NETWORK SEGMENTATION &amp; MICROSEGMENTATION 19</p></div>",
