            "rawHtml": "<h3>05 -- LAYER 7 MICROSEGMENTATION</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Visibility Pays Off at Every Stage Before deployment</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>Segmentation rules can be pre-built for new or updated applications before they ever go live. In production Real-time detection flags application activity outside the norm before it becomes an active exploit. After an incident Historical context shows exactly which environment allowed an anomaly -- tighten policy and document for compliance. Traditional application segmentation struggles to deliver this all-in-one view because it leans on a patchwork of network-centric technologies. NETWORK SEGMENTATION &amp; MICROSEGMENTATION 21</p></div>",
