            "eyebrow": "CIT 220 • Unit 02.2",
            "subtitle": "Approach Three: Microsegmentation to Layer 7 & Ransomware Defense",
            "lead": "06 -- ZERO TRUST \"No traffic or user is trusted",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>06 -- ZERO TRUST</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">&quot;No traffic or user is trusted</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>until proven so.&quot; Coined by Forrester in 2010. Microsegmentation is what makes it operationally real. Forrester&#x27;s three principles of Zero Trust All entities are untrusted by default Nothing -- internal or external -- is assumed safe. Every connection attempt has to prove itself, every time. Comprehensive security monitoring is implemented Continuous, granular visibility replaces the old assumption that anything inside the perimeter is already cleared. Least-privilege access is enforced Every entity gets exactly the access it needs to function The &quot;castle and moat&quot; is obsolete -- most companies no longer have a single contained network or data center to defend. NETWORK SEGMENTATION &amp; MICROSEGMENTATION 22</p></div><ul class=\"compact mt-3\"><li>and no more -- enforced down to the process level.</li></ul>",
            "cleanText": "06 -- ZERO TRUST \"No traffic or user is trusted until proven so.\" Coined by Forrester in 2010. Microsegmentation is what makes it operationally real. Forrester's three principles of Zero Trust All entities are untrusted by default Nothing -- internal or external -- is assumed safe. Every connection attempt has to prove itself, every time. Comprehensive security monitoring is implemented Continuous, granular visibility replaces the old assumption that anything inside the perimeter is already cleared. Least-privilege access is enforced Every entity gets exactly the access it needs to function -- and no more -- enforced down to the process level. The \"castle and moat\" is obsolete -- most companies no longer have a single contained network or data center to defend. NETWORK SEGMENTATION & MICROSEGMENTATION 22",
